content:
spc closed last night. 💀

3 more close this month. everything still open for pre-idea founders:

@join_ef london fall 26 closes TOMORROW (aug 4). no cofounder, no idea needed. 12 weeks london then 3 months SF

@SkyDeck_Cal batch 23 closes aug 21. $210k, 6 months berkeley. ~2/3 of their startups are founded outside the US

@join_ef the bridge residency closes aug 30. 8 weeks in SF, built for young europeans

@AntlerGlobal germany sep 14, australia sep 21, UK sep 22, singapore + kenya oct 5. day zero investing, pre-team is fine

@ycombinator f26 late apps are still being read. early decision is also open for w27, spring and summer

@neo residency rolling. $750k UNCAPPED safe + $450k compute. no fixed equity, they take up to 5% at your next round only. led cursor + kalshi seeds

@GreylockVC edge rolling. 3 months, pre-idea welcome, $500k+ credits, and you can take zero capital from them

@hf0 rolling. $1m uncapped for 5%, 12 weeks SF, housing + food covered. 10 teams at a time, repeat/technical founders

@EWOR_official rolling. €500k with no tuition fee if you have traction, up to €300k for 3% if you don't. top 0.1%, virtual-first

AI House (formerly AI2 incubator) rolling. up to $600k + up to $1m in cloud credits. remote is fine, ~15 teams a year

@Soma_Capital fellowship rolling. up to $1m uncapped, zero equity

@betaworks camp rolling. up to $500k, 12 weeks NYC, AI-native only

@AforeVC founder-in-residence rolling. 10 weeks SF, they back you at -1 to 0

@zfellows rolling. $10k at a $1b cap for one week. apply solo, no company needed

techstars fall 26 shut on jun 10 and conviction embed doesn't reopen till next year. stop waiting for the big names. 💀

follow @arorabhavyam for weekly content around founders, startups and AI! 🫡
